      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# H3 staged decode\n\nSelect the `.h3latent.pt` produced by the sampling workflow.\n\nVideo decode uses 512px spatial tiles with 16-frame temporal tiles.\nSampling, video VAE, audio VAE and muxing are intentionally separate\nexecution stages so the 1344x768 result does not reset ComfyUI.\n\nSaveVideo is explicit lossless H.264 re-encode with CRF 0; do not use\n`auto`, which produced an unnecessarily low bitrate.\n\nExpected result: 1344x768, 124 frames, 24 fps, synchronised stereo AAC."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
